FROM /v0.1.4/demos/local-llm/Dollyfile-pi-local 9c1c5080ebbf17c4bc1415d369746cd9470a770a0cc59684a3b4174925f2e494
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/neovim/Dollyfile-nvim 0a7c78be608f23ee844f425baa38e782fbbdf185f7b6ac7bfa2eccc1665aff4c
REQUIRES TOOL pi
